"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">32</div><h1>분사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Partizip I und Partizip II</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 32의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">현재분사(~하고 있는)와 과거분사(~된·~한)를 뜻에 맞게 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">명사 앞 분사에 격과 관사에 맞는 형용사 어미를 붙여요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">관사와 명사 사이가 긴 분사구를 읽고, 관계문과 서로 바꿔요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">분사를 명사로 쓰고 spannend·gespannt 같은 짝을 구별해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schlafende&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Leise, das Baby ist gerade eingeschlafen. Weck das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schlafen)</span> Kind bitte nicht!</div><div class=\"qko\">조용히 해요, 아기가 방금 잠들었어요. 자고 있는 아이를 깨우지 마세요!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Leise, das Baby ist gerade eingeschlafen. Weck das <b>schlafende</b> Kind bitte nicht!</div>'~하고 있는'은 현재분사(원형 + d)예요.<br>정관사 das + 중성 4격이라 약변화 어미 -e를 붙여요 → das schlafende Kind.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gekochte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Zum Mittagessen gab es <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(kochen)</span> Kartoffeln mit Quark.</div><div class=\"qko\">점심으로 삶은 감자와 크바르크가 나왔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zum Mittagessen gab es <b>gekochte</b> Kartoffeln mit Quark.</div>이미 삶아진 것은 과거분사 gekocht예요.<br>es gibt 뒤는 4격이에요. 관사 없는 복수 4격이라 강변화 어미 -e예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Viele Familien suchen eine Lösung für die <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Mieten. (계속 오르고 있는 집세)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gestiegenen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) steigenden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) steigend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) steigende</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금도 오르고 있으니 현재분사 steigend예요.<br>für die + 복수 4격이라 약변화 -en → die steigenden Mieten.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Wir waren alle <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, als er plötzlich vor der Tür stand.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) überraschend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) überrascht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) überraschten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) überraschte</button></div><div class=\"qe\">놀라움을 '받은' 쪽은 과거분사형 überrascht예요.<br>sein 뒤라서 어미가 붙지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;enttäuschend&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Das Konzert war ziemlich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(enttäuschen)</span>. Die Band hat nur 40 Minuten gespielt.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 공연은 꽤 실망스러웠어요. 밴드가 40분밖에 연주하지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Konzert war ziemlich <b>enttäuschend</b>. Die Band hat nur 40 Minuten gespielt.</div>실망을 '주는' 쪽은 현재분사형 enttäuschend예요.<br>실망한 사람은 enttäuscht예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schreiend&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> In der Pause rannten die Kinder <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schreien)</span> über den Schulhof.</div><div class=\"qko\">쉬는 시간에 아이들이 소리를 지르며 운동장을 뛰어다녔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · In der Pause rannten die Kinder <b>schreiend</b> über den Schulhof.</div>'~하면서'라는 동시 동작은 현재분사를 부사로 써요.<br>부사라서 어미가 없어요 → schreiend.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Die Polizei hat ein <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Fahrrad am Flussufer gefunden. (도난당한 자전거)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gestohlene</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) stehlendes</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) gestohlen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) gestohlenes</button></div><div class=\"qe\">도난당한 것은 과거분사 gestohlen(수동의 뜻)이에요.<br>ein + 중성 4격이라 혼합변화 -es → ein gestohlenes Fahrrad.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Die gerade <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Passagiere warten am Band auf ihr Gepäck. (막 도착한 승객들)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ankommende</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) angekommene</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) angekommen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) angekommenen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ankommen은 sein과 쓰는 이동 동사라서 과거분사가 '도착한'(완료)이라는 뜻이에요.<br>정관사 die + 복수 1격 → 약변화 -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Teilnehmenden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Alle <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:15ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(teilnehmen · 현재분사를 명사로)</span> bekommen am Ende des Kurses ein Zertifikat.</div><div class=\"qko\">모든 수강생은 강좌가 끝날 때 수료증을 받아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Alle <b>Teilnehmenden</b> bekommen am Ende des Kurses ein Zertifikat.</div>현재분사를 명사로 쓰면 '~하는 사람'이에요 — der/die Teilnehmende.<br>alle 뒤의 복수는 약변화 -en이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Verletzten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Bei dem Unfall gab es zum Glück nur einen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(verletzen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 사고에서 다행히 부상자는 한 명뿐이었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bei dem Unfall gab es zum Glück nur einen <b>Verletzten</b>.</div>과거분사 verletzt를 명사로 쓰면 '부상자'예요. 형용사처럼 어미가 붙어요.<br>einen + 남성 4격 → 혼합변화 -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Eine <span class=\"qblank\"></span> fragte mich am Bahnhof nach dem Weg zum Hotel.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Reisenden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Reisender</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Reisende</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Reisendes</button></div><div class=\"qe\">여성 여행자 한 명이라 eine + 여성 1격 → -e, eine Reisende예요.<br>Reisender는 남성(ein Reisender)이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ausgefüllte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Bitte geben Sie das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ausfüllen)</span> Formular bis Freitag im Sekretariat ab.</div><div class=\"qko\">작성한 서류를 금요일까지 사무실에 제출해 주세요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bitte geben Sie das <b>ausgefüllte</b> Formular bis Freitag im Sekretariat ab.</div>작성된 서류는 과거분사예요. ausfüllen은 분리동사라 ausgefüllt예요.<br>das + 중성 4격 → 약변화 -e.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die bellenden Hunde haben mich die ganze Nacht wach gehalten&quot;,&quot;Die ganze Nacht haben mich die bellenden Hunde wach gehalten&quot;,&quot;Mich haben die bellenden Hunde die ganze Nacht wach gehalten&quot;,&quot;Die ganze Nacht haben die bellenden Hunde mich wach gehalten&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">짖는 개들 때문에 나는 밤새 잠을 못 잤어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Hunde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">wach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">gehalten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">bellenden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">haben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Nacht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">ganze</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die bellenden Hunde haben mich die ganze Nacht wach gehalten.</b></div>현재분사 bellend는 관사와 명사 사이에 오고 어미가 붙어요 → die bellenden Hunde.<br>haben이 두 번째 자리, 과거분사 gehalten이 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gemachten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Die im Urlaub <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(machen)</span> Fotos habe ich in ein Album geklebt.</div><div class=\"qko\">휴가 때 찍은 사진들을 앨범에 붙였어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die im Urlaub <b>gemachten</b> Fotos habe ich in ein Album geklebt.</div>찍힌 사진이라 과거분사 gemacht예요.<br>die + 복수 4격 → 약변화 -en. im Urlaub는 분사 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> die Frau, die an der Kasse wartet → die an der Kasse <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Frau</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) wartenden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) wartend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) wartende</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) gewartete</button></div><div class=\"qe\">능동·진행이라 현재분사 wartend예요.<br>die + 여성 1격 → 약변화 -e.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> der von allen gelobte Koch = ?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) der Koch, der von allen gelobt wird</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) alle, die den Koch loben werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) der Koch, der von allen loben wird</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) der Koch, der alle lobt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거분사 gelobt는 수동의 뜻이에요 — 모두에게 칭찬받는 요리사.<br>관계문으로 풀면 수동 wird … gelobt예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Mit <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Herzen öffnete sie den Brief der Universität.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) geklopftem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) klopfenden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) klopfendem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) klopfend</button></div><div class=\"qe\">두근거리고 있는 심장이라 현재분사 klopfend예요.<br>관사 없는 중성 3격이라 강변화 -em → mit klopfendem Herzen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;],[&quot;steht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> die seit Jahren leer stehende Fabrik<br>= die Fabrik, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> seit Jahren leer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"></div><div class=\"qko\">몇 년째 비어 있는 공장</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · die seit Jahren leer stehende Fabrik<br>= die Fabrik, <b>die</b> seit Jahren leer <b>steht</b></div>관사 die와 명사 Fabrik 사이를 관계문으로 풀어요.<br>현재분사 stehend → 관계문 현재 die … steht.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gebauten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Wir wohnen in einem im 18. Jahrhundert <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bauen)</span> Haus.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 18세기에 지어진 집에 살아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir wohnen in einem im 18. Jahrhundert <b>gebauten</b> Haus.</div>지어진 집이라 과거분사 gebaut예요.<br>in einem + 중성 3격 → 혼합변화 -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der seit Stunden am Gleis wartende Mann ist mein Onkel&quot;,&quot;Der am Gleis seit Stunden wartende Mann ist mein Onkel&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">몇 시간째 승강장에서 기다리고 있는 남자가 제 삼촌이에요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Stunden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Onkel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Mann</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">mein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">seit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Gleis</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">wartende</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">am</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der seit Stunden am Gleis wartende Mann ist mein Onkel.</b></div>관사 der와 명사 Mann 사이에 설명(seit Stunden am Gleis)이 들어가고, 명사 바로 앞에 현재분사 wartende가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Der erste Arbeitstag war <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, und ich war ziemlich <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) aufgeregt … aufgeregt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) aufregend … aufregend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) aufgeregt … aufregend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) aufregend … aufgeregt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">긴장을 '주는' 첫 출근 날은 aufregend, 긴장을 '받은' 나는 aufgeregt예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Auszubildende&quot;],[&quot;Auszubildenden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Unsere Firma hat dieses Jahr drei neue <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:15ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ausbilden · 현재분사를 명사로)</span> eingestellt. Einer der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:16ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(ausbilden · 현재분사를 명사로)</span> kommt aus Hamburg.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 회사는 올해 새 직업 훈련생 세 명을 뽑았어요. 그 훈련생들 중 한 명은 함부르크 출신이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Unsere Firma hat dieses Jahr drei neue <b>Auszubildende</b> eingestellt. Einer der <b>Auszubildenden</b> kommt aus Hamburg.</div>분사 명사는 형용사 어미를 따라요.<br>① 관사 없이 neue 뒤의 복수 4격 → 강변화 -e.<br>② der + 복수 2격 → 약변화 -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 'Der Zug, der gerade abfährt, ist voll.'과 뜻이 같은 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Der gerade abfahrende Zug ist voll.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Der gerade abgefahrende Zug ist voll.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Der gerade abfahrend Zug ist voll.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Der gerade abgefahrene Zug ist voll.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금 떠나고 있는 중이라 현재분사 abfahrend예요. 명사 앞이라 어미 -e를 붙여요.<br>abgefahren은 이미 떠난 기차예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;geschickten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Den von dir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schicken)</span> Brief habe ich leider nie bekommen.</div><div class=\"qko\">네가 보낸 편지를 나는 결국 받지 못했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Den von dir <b>geschickten</b> Brief habe ich leider nie bekommen.</div>보내진 편지라 과거분사 geschickt예요.<br>den + 남성 4격 → 약변화 -en. von dir는 분사 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der gestern angekommene Brief</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) die in Berlin gewohnte Familie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) das frisch gestrichene Zimmer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) die auf dem Spielplatz laufenden Kinder</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 앞 과거분사는 4격 목적어를 갖는 동사(수동)나 sein과 쓰는 이동·변화 동사(완료)만 돼요.<br>wohnen은 둘 다 아니라서 현재분사로 써야 해요 → die in Berlin wohnende Familie.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gegründeten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Die Firma wurde vor zehn Jahren von zwei Studentinnen gegründet. Heute arbeiten dort 500 Menschen.<br>→ In der vor zehn Jahren von zwei Studentinnen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(gründen)</span> Firma arbeiten heute 500 Menschen.</div><div class=\"qko\">10년 전에 두 여대생이 세운 그 회사에서 지금은 500명이 일해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Firma wurde vor zehn Jahren von zwei Studentinnen gegründet. Heute arbeiten dort 500 Menschen.<br>→ In der vor zehn Jahren von zwei Studentinnen <b>gegründeten</b> Firma arbeiten heute 500 Menschen.</div>수동(wurde gegründet)은 과거분사로 바꿔요.<br>in der + 여성 3격 → 약변화 -en. 관사 der와 명사 Firma 사이가 길어도 어미는 관사와 명사로 정해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe den von meiner Oma gestrickten Schal im Bus vergessen&quot;,&quot;Den von meiner Oma gestrickten Schal habe ich im Bus vergessen&quot;,&quot;Im Bus habe ich den von meiner Oma gestrickten Schal vergessen&quot;,&quot;Ich habe im Bus den von meiner Oma gestrickten Schal vergessen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">할머니가 떠 주신 목도리를 버스에 두고 내렸어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Oma</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Schal</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Bus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">gestrickten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">vergessen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">meiner</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe den von meiner Oma gestrickten Schal im Bus vergessen.</b></div>관사 den → 설명 von meiner Oma → 과거분사 gestrickten → 명사 Schal 순서예요.<br>이 덩어리 전체가 한 자리를 차지해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;],[&quot;anbietet&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> die ihren Kunden kostenlose Beratung anbietende Bank<br>= die Bank, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ihren Kunden kostenlose Beratung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"></div><div class=\"qko\">고객에게 무료 상담을 제공하는 은행</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · die ihren Kunden kostenlose Beratung anbietende Bank<br>= die Bank, <b>die</b> ihren Kunden kostenlose Beratung <b>anbietet</b></div>현재분사 anbietend → 관계문 현재형이에요.<br>관계문에서는 분리동사가 다시 붙어 맨 끝에 와요 → anbietet.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> '상처를 주는 말'과 '다친 선수'를 바르게 옮긴 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) eine verletzte Bemerkung · ein verletzender Spieler</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) eine verletzende Bemerkung · ein verletzender Spieler</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) eine verletzende Bemerkung · ein verletzter Spieler</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) eine verletzte Bemerkung · ein verletzter Spieler</button></div><div class=\"qe\">상처를 '주는' 말은 현재분사 verletzend, 상처를 '입은' 선수는 과거분사 verletzt예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schreiende&quot;],[&quot;bestellte&quot;],[&quot;erschrockene&quot;,&quot;erschreckte&quot;],[&quot;stotternd&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> Der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schreien)</span> Kunde beschwerte sich über das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(bestellen)</span> Essen, das kalt war. Die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(erschrecken)</span> Kellnerin entschuldigte sich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(stottern)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">소리치는 손님은 자기가 주문한 음식이 차갑다고 불평했어요. 깜짝 놀란 종업원은 말을 더듬으며 사과했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der <b>schreiende</b> Kunde beschwerte sich über das <b>bestellte</b> Essen, das kalt war. Die <b>erschrockene</b> Kellnerin entschuldigte sich <b>stotternd</b>.</div>① 소리치고 있는 → schreiende(der + 남성 1격 -e).<br>② 주문된 → bestellte(das + 중성 4격 -e).<br>③ 놀란 → erschrocken(자동사 erschrecken의 불규칙 과거분사), 여성 1격 -e.<br>④ 더듬으며 → 부사 stotternd, 어미 없음.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"